# git-secrets false positives.
#
# `git secrets --aws-provider` reads ~/.aws/credentials and emits each
# profile's key values as literal scan patterns. One profile here holds
# short placeholder values (the localstack convention), so those
# placeholders become patterns that fire on ordinary English words
# appearing anywhere in a diff. The real fix is to drop that profile or
# give it realistic dummy values; until then, narrow allowances below.

mysqladmin", "ping"
